	(text "AP2112K: 600 mA; 1 uF in and out (Diodes datasheet).\n+5V minus one Schottky >= 4.5 V: above 3.3 V + 400 mV\ndropout (ASSUMPTION: at 600 mA). Load < 100 mA.\nC212: the 4.7 uF bulk on VDD (DS11929 Fig. 16)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "255ad911-0472-5c10-8956-1ecdc074a1ef")
	)
	(text "3.3 V LDO (AP2112K-3.3)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 120.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5328b0e3-ee58-5b1c-a2d8-b5fdc7221e81")
	)
	(text "Input 24 V nominal, 30 V max (HW-PWR-001). Parts on VM rated >= 52 V:\nDRV8711 8-52 V (SLVSC40H 6.3), LMR36510 4.2-65 V (SNVSBD7B 1), CSD18543Q3A 60 V.\nF201 3 A fast sets VM's class PWR_3A.\nQ201 in the return leg: body diode first, then R201 enhances it; D202 clamps\nVGS to 15 V (max +-20 V). D201: VRWM 33 V over 30 V, VC 53.3 V under 60 V\n(ASSUMPTION: VC at 7.5 A). C201/C202: DRV8711 bulk (SLVSC40H 9.1).\nVM_SENSE = VM x 10k/110k: 30 V -> 2.73 V; fc 175 Hz (derived)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 60.96 92.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bd14bb5f-1336-5779-814e-ffe9cbe26b15")
	)
	(text "Net classes"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 214.63 120.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "df74a021-d3bb-56c1-94fd-f68d89c3b6a3")
	)
	(text "5 V buck (LMR36510, SNVSBD7B 8.2 Design 1)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 204.47 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e1621ad7-6289-5a21-bc70-5857d666013f")
	)
	(text "Table 8-1, 400 kHz, 5 V: L 22 uH, COUT 2 x 22 uF,\nRFBT 100k / RFBB 24.9k: VOUT = 1.0 V x (1 + 100/24.9)\n= 5.02 V. CIN 2.2 uF + 220 nF (4.7 uF used, 50 V).\nEN tied to VIN; PG open drain, pulled to +3V3.\nD203/D204 OR the buck with USB VBUS (~0.4 V drop).\nASSUMPTION: L201 Isat >= 1 A (SWPA4030S)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 97.79 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ea37d68d-eaaa-5410-84ea-b1cdd2467508")
	)
